<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Transportation.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Transportation.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Swift Transportation Co Inc to buy from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Swift gained one to 27.</p>
